Ray: Chrome's third-party cookie default (Helium's blocks them; Teams' app tabs need them). Adds the series patch
chromium-third-party-cookies-allowed.patch after Helium's prefs changes.

diff --git a/patches/chromium-third-party-cookies-allowed.patch b/patches/chromium-third-party-cookies-allowed.patch
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..f06181e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/patches/chromium-third-party-cookies-allowed.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+Ray: Chrome's third-party cookie default. Helium's inox-patchset/modify-default-prefs.patch registers
+profile.cookie_controls_mode as kBlockThirdParty; Chrome (and Arc) allow third-party cookies outside private windows
+(kIncognitoOnly), and sites that embed another site's page need them (Teams' app tabs). A user's own choice in
+chrome://settings/cookies still wins. Ray's app also writes this value into profiles that never chose
+(Host/ProfileDefaults.swift), for engines built before this patch.
+
+--- a/components/content_settings/core/browser/cookie_settings.cc
++++ b/components/content_settings/core/browser/cookie_settings.cc
+@@ -78,7 +78,7 @@
+     user_prefs::PrefRegistrySyncable* registry) {
+   registry->RegisterIntegerPref(
+       prefs::kCookieControlsMode,
+-      static_cast<int>(CookieControlsMode::kBlockThirdParty),
++      static_cast<int>(CookieControlsMode::kIncognitoOnly),
+       user_prefs::PrefRegistrySyncable::SYNCABLE_PREF);
+ }
+ 
diff --git a/patches/series b/patches/series
--- a/patches/series
+++ b/patches/series
@@ -107,3 +107,4 @@
 chromium chromium-ungoogled-mime-util-ymp.patch
 chromium chromium-background-instance-no-default-handlers.patch mac
+chromium chromium-third-party-cookies-allowed.patch
 chromium chromium-apple-passwords-host-skipped.patch mac
